<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-25T06:31:57.762Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 06:31:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to assault villages in northeast and eastern Nigeria, killing at least ten civilians and looting shops, while a separate raid on a village after Friday prayers left twenty dead and the death toll later rose to forty. Armed groups also targeted electricity workers in Benue, prompting a service withdrawal, and killed a woman and injured two farmers in Plateau. Bandits killed seven vigilantes and abducted thirty-eight people in Zamfara. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFA4UW9NSndxUVdNWUY0LWp6WFFuSVdWN011TmZ6LTM0Y0ljMTFrczhlOW8wdmw3aGo4aElJSW1RX2NwT0VZRHlrWk90Y1ZGVFRGMktial9Ycm4yVkU?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPU0JGZ1FFUGNTVFVLMi1HQi14VjhsbTQ3SExaX3Y5d1VJZE9kYW9xYzk5M1ptdEpVZF83ZXotRWFxZHIwQS1UdEROQnNkbG1jRXBtLXYxSllBRG1fR2x2Tkoyc3BHUEJOdjhWOGkydkpWQU5odC0yc0ZFQ2lQbUlBWE1yWHI3RUdxMU9SWWFDbHA?oc=5&quot;&gt;خبرگزاری بین المللی قرآن&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxPZ3A5VER3azVWbzdmemsyU1p4YmQyWmJRWUVVU3VNTkNmVTRRbG1uazh2MnZib0JNVS1MWmhXNG5ZUnFqckk2dl9kUmxBWWhFc1V6T2ViaTJPdm9GN3g4SHl0OVpIQWludWVFek5DVGVIOHAySmowMTFyNGk1cWZ1SHVHZG52amlHVFhrcHJVVUtlcFhOb0RJXw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPdG5DMEFuMkV3QkZfSy1MbzM0b1Vsc0FlY1JjUm5ELWk5NTF3Z25HRGN4Ul9ab3dkZkJ3cEc0UEp3S05iNlplWXgwYWFCeDJwRGRwck5zZzVJcDNlQVpNNGVONFE4QmxuTWlMWk1oMk1LSFRDdFF1MVVBbldHRkd1RXpwV1loSHo5RWZmSXltM25DOGxUdXBPd0std1ZSUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQSFhlR0ZJaXVEdFBNQ0